From 391ea298c6d5329fb3bf1fd74c19e4b13104dc73 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: jm9100-oss <jm9100-oss@local>
Date: Tue, 20 Oct 2026 19:38:34 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] mwv207 winsys: fix init error handling, hash-key misuse,
 realloc leaks, fence_wait units

- winsys: check fcntl(F_DUPFD_CLOEXEC) and CTX ioctl; fail create_screen
  instead of caching a dead winsys in the global fd table.
- bo: fix ptr-key hash misuse (insert vs lookup/remove key mismatch),
  'co->name' typo, CALLOC/final NULL checks, flink/mmap error paths.
- cs: leak-safe reallocs with loop growth, per-cmdbuf bo access flags
  (was clobbering shared slab BO state), fence_wait timeout units and
  PIPE_TIMEOUT_INFINITE handling.
---
 src/gallium/drivers/mwv207/meson.build        |  4 +-
 src/gallium/drivers/mwv207/mwv207_context.c   | 25 ++++-
 src/gallium/drivers/mwv207/mwv207_resource.c  | 12 +++
 src/gallium/drivers/mwv207/mwv207_screen.c    | 23 ++---
 .../drivers/mwv207/nir/mwv207_disasm.h        | 13 +++
 src/gallium/winsys/mwv207/drm/mwv207_drm_bo.c | 47 +++++++---
 src/gallium/winsys/mwv207/drm/mwv207_drm_cs.c | 92 +++++++++++++++----
 .../winsys/mwv207/drm/mwv207_drm_winsys.c     | 37 +++++++-
 8 files changed, 193 insertions(+), 60 deletions(-)

